flowchart TD
  Start["Effect dispatched"] --> Outcome{"Remote outcome"}
  Outcome -->|"429 / 5xx / timeout"| Retry["Bounded retry · Stable original key"]
  Outcome -->|"Permanent rejection"| Dead["Durable exception · Operator review"]
  Outcome -->|"Commit; worker dies"| Unknown["Uncertain durable intent"]
  Unknown --> Lease["Lease expires · New token fences old worker"]
  Lease --> Lookup["Look up original downstream receipt"]
  Retry --> Lookup
  Lookup --> Match{"Receipt + payload match?"}
  Match -->|Yes| Ack["Record committed fact · No second effect"]
  Match -->|Absent| Recheck["Recheck current authorization before resend"]
  Match -->|Conflict| Dead
  Recheck -->|"Revoked / expired / stale"| Block["Block dispatch"]
  Recheck -->|Allowed| Start
